  "details": "Firstly, I miss the old loading screen. The issue with the new loading screen is that it doesn't really fit well. I enjoyed the deep space background regardless of it being a stock unity asset. It at least gave VRChat a nice feeling of mystery whenever you loaded into a world.\n\nSecondly, I really think we need a new loading soundtrack. I don't hate the current one, I just am tired of hearing it all the time.\n\nUpdate: \nErick McNerney (The music creator) has uploaded different variants of the new loading screen on his YouTube channel.\n\nLink: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRknKfyTwrI",
